<div class="cart__item" data-key="{{ product.key }}">
  <div class="cart__image">
    {% if product.image != blank %}
      <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="image-wrap">
        {%- render 'image-element',
          img: product,
          alt: product.product.title,
          widths: '180, 360, 540',
          sizes: sizes,
          sizeVariable: sizeVariable,
          fallback: fallback,
        -%}
      </a>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="cart__item-details">
    <div class="cart__item-title">
      <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="cart__item-name">
        {{ product.product.title }}
      </a>
      {%- comment -%} Live stock count, 2 Nov 2026, REF v4. The store's own number, at 60 or fewer. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if product.variant.inventory_management == 'shopify' and product.variant.inventory_quantity > 0 and product.variant.inventory_quantity <= 60 -%}
        <div class="cart__item--variants tl-cart-stock">Only {{ product.variant.inventory_quantity }} left.</div>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- unless product.product.has_only_default_variant -%}
        <div class="cart__item--variants">
          {%- for option in product.options_with_values -%}
            <div><span>{{ option.name }}:</span> {{ option.value }}</div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endunless -%}
      {%- if product.selling_plan_allocation != empty -%}
        <div class="cart__item--variants">
          {{ product.selling_plan_allocation.selling_plan.name }}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- assign property_size = product.properties | size -%}
      {% if property_size > 0 %}
        {% for p in product.properties %}
          {%- assign first_character_in_key = p.first | truncate: 1, '' -%}
          {% unless p.last == blank or first_character_in_key == '_' %}
            <div class="cart__item--properties">
              <span>{{ p.first }}:</span>
              {% if p.last contains '/uploads/' %}
                <a href="{{ p.last }}">{{ p.last | split: '/' | last }}</a>
              {% else %}
                {{ p.last }}
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          {% endunless %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}

    </div>
    <div class="cart__item-sub">
      <div>
        <div class="js-qty__wrapper">
          <label for="cart_updates_{{ product.key }}" class="hidden-label">{{ 'cart.label.quantity' | t }}</label>
          <input type="text"
            id="cart_updates_{{ product.key }}"
            name="updates[]"
            class="js-qty__num"
            value="{{ product.quantity }}"
            min="0"
            pattern="[0-9]*"
            data-id="{{ product.key }}">
          <button type="button"
            class="js-qty__adjust js-qty__adjust--minus"
            aria-label="{{ 'cart.general.reduce_quantity' | t }}">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon-minus" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill="#444" d="M17.543 11.029H2.1A1.032 1.032 0 0 1 1.071 10c0-.566.463-1.029 1.029-1.029h15.443c.566 0 1.029.463 1.029 1.029 0 .566-.463 1.029-1.029 1.029z"/></svg>
              <span class="icon__fallback-text" aria-hidden="true">&minus;</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button"
            class="js-qty__adjust js-qty__adjust--plus"
            aria-label="{{ 'cart.general.increase_quantity' | t }}">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon-plus" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill="#444" d="M17.409 8.929h-6.695V2.258c0-.566-.506-1.029-1.071-1.029s-1.071.463-1.071 1.029v6.671H1.967C1.401 8.929.938 9.435.938 10s.463 1.071 1.029 1.071h6.605V17.7c0 .566.506 1.029 1.071 1.029s1.071-.463 1.071-1.029v-6.629h6.695c.566 0 1.029-.506 1.029-1.071s-.463-1.071-1.029-1.071z"/></svg>
              <span class="icon__fallback-text" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="cart__remove">
          <a href="{{ routes.cart_change_url }}?id={{ product.key }}&amp;quantity=0" class="text-link">
            {{ 'cart.general.remove' | t }}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cart__item-price-col text-right">
        {%- comment -%}
          22 Oct 2026, operator instruction. NO STRUCK-THROUGH PRICE IN THE BASKET.
          The theme default crossed out the bottle price and showed a discounted
          per-bottle figure whenever a code applied, which is a was-and-now price
          and is banned on every surface. The line now shows the bottle price once,
          and the code underneath with what it takes off. The subtotal shows what
          the customer pays. Do not restore the strikethrough.

          3 Nov 2026, his word: the discount line was the full discount title in
          a narrow column and broke over five lines. It now shows "each" after
          the bottle price when there is more than one, and only the last part
          of the title (the Mix titles end "· 10% off") with the amount kept on
          one line. Titles with no "·" show in full.

          8 Nov 2026, his word "crossed out prices do like ezra suggested". The
          one exception to the 22 Oct rule: a line cut by the Black Friday 15%
          (the automatic discount "Black Friday · 15% off") or by an early access
          code (codes start EARLY-) shows the line's shop price struck through,
          the price paid for the line in green, and "Black Friday · 15% off"
          (or "Early access · 15% off" for a code) under it. It reads discount_allocations, so it works whether the 15%
          is a product or an order discount. Every other code, the welcome code
          among them, keeps the look above.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign tl_bf_amt = 0
          assign tl_bf_cut = false
          assign tl_bf_gift = false
          assign tl_bf_word = 'Black Friday · 15% off'
          for da in product.discount_allocations
            assign tl_da_t = da.discount_application.title | default: ''
            assign tl_da_code = tl_da_t | slice: 0, 6 | upcase
            if tl_da_t == 'Black Friday · 15% off' or tl_da_code == 'EARLY-'
              assign tl_bf_amt = tl_bf_amt | plus: da.amount
              assign tl_bf_cut = true
              if tl_da_code == 'EARLY-'
                assign tl_bf_word = 'Early access · 15% off'
              endif
            elsif tl_da_t == 'Black Friday · a bottle of Smederevka free with £100 or more'
              comment
                The weekend gift, DiscountAutomaticNode/2294435742041, 8 Nov 2026.
              endcomment
              assign tl_bf_amt = tl_bf_amt | plus: da.amount
              assign tl_bf_gift = true
            endif
          endfor
          assign tl_bf_pay = product.original_line_price | minus: tl_bf_amt
        -%}
        {%- if tl_bf_amt > 0 -%}
        <span class="cart__price tl-cart-bf">
          <b class="tl-cw__now">{% if tl_bf_pay <= 0 %}Free{% else %}{{ tl_bf_pay | money }}{% endif %}</b> <s class="tl-was"><span class="visually-hidden">Was </span>{{ product.original_line_price | money }}</s>
        </span>
        {%- if tl_bf_gift -%}
          <small class="cart__discount tl-cart-off">{% if product.quantity > 1 %}One bottle free with your order{% else %}Free with your order{% endif %}</small>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if tl_bf_cut -%}
          <small class="cart__discount tl-cart-off">{{ tl_bf_word }}</small>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- else -%}
        <span class="cart__price">
          {{ product.original_price | money }}{% if product.quantity > 1 %}<span class="tl-cart-each"> each</span>{% endif %}
        </span>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if tl_bf_amt == 0 and product.line_level_discount_allocations != blank -%}
          {%- for discount_allocation in product.line_level_discount_allocations -%}
            {%- assign tl_off_title = discount_allocation.discount_application.title | split: ' · ' | last -%}
            <small class="cart__discount tl-cart-off">{{ tl_off_title }} <span class="tl-nowrap">(-{{ discount_allocation.amount | money }})</span></small>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if product.unit_price_measurement -%}
          {%- capture unit_price_base_unit -%}
            <span class="unit-price-base">
              {%- if product.unit_price_measurement -%}
                {%- if product.unit_price_measurement.reference_value != 1 -%}
                  {{ product.unit_price_measurement.reference_value }}
                {%- endif -%}
                {{ product.unit_price_measurement.reference_unit }}
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
          {%- endcapture -%}

          <div class="product__unit-price">{{ product.unit_price | money }}/{{ unit_price_base_unit }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
